@step Review the local filing records for the target.
@result aeat --format json app modelo filing-record list
@expect result.operation == "modelo.filing_record.list"
@expect result.include_superseded == false
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Import an external filing record from official evidence.
@static aeat app modelo filing-record import <work-unit-id> --evidence-kind aeat_justificante_pdf --evidence-id <justificante-or-capture-id> --set <casilla>=<value>
@blocked operator-artifact Needs a real AEAT justificante PDF and its evidence id; no local chain produces one and it must not be fabricated as a committed fixture.
@step Inspect, check, and export an evidence bundle by id.
@static aeat app modelo audit export <bundle-id> --output ./modelo-390-evidence.zip
@blocked unconverted No aeat verb creates an evidence bundle, so no id exists to address: the audit view, check and export verbs only read bundles, and nothing in the CLI writes one.
